<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Jaya Tiasa year net down six pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Jaya Tiasa year net down six pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     140.61	    vs	  149.64</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  55.4	     vs	   59.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 427.27	    vs	  399.16</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 162.67	    vs	  159.71</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)  10.0	     vs	   10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Jaya Tiasa Holdings Bhd is in the plywood, blockboard and sawn timber business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
